``` Account Lockout Spike
    Purpose : Detect an unusual number of account lockouts in one hour, which can
              indicate password spraying or a misconfigured service.
    Data    : Windows Security log, EventCode 4740 (account locked out).
    Controls: AC-7, SI-4
    Tuning  : Compare against a rolling baseline instead of a fixed number once
              you have a few weeks of data.
    Example environment: Harborlight Logistics (fictional). ```
index=wineventlog sourcetype="WinEventLog:Security" EventCode=4740
| bin _time span=1h
| stats dc(TargetUserName) AS locked_accounts values(TargetUserName) AS accounts values(CallerComputerName) AS caller_hosts BY _time
| where locked_accounts >= 5
| sort - locked_accounts
